  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Capacity building for Budget Support and Policy Dialogue in Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 73, 125);&quot;&gt;The objective of the action is to contribute to prepare the formulation and implementation of an effective budget support operation in Zambia. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 73, 125);&quot;&gt;The specific objectives will be: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 73, 125);&quot;&gt;1-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Establish the foundation of a solid policy dialogue with the Government of Zambia, within the budget support framework.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 73, 125);&quot;&gt;2-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Train technical staff at the EUD and key cooperating partners (EU-MS, World Bank) and within beneficiary institutions and sensitize senior management to the requirements and operations of the budget support modality;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
